        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2000 Solheim Cup\n- Places: Loch Lomond Golf Club, Luss, Dunbartonshire, Scotland\n- Organizations: Clan Colquhoun\n- Buildings: Rossdhu Mansion\n\nFacts:\n- The 6th Solheim Cup Match was held from 6 to 8 October 2000.\n- The 2000 Solheim Cup took place at Loch Lomond Golf Club in Luss, Dunbartonshire, Scotland.\n- Loch Lomond Golf Club occupies land that was previously held by Clan Colquhoun.\n- Loch Lomond Golf Club uses Rossdhu Mansion, the seat of Clan Colquhoun, as its clubhouse.",
